flowchart TD
    Req[Command API]
    Policy[Authorization policy]
    Tx[Database transaction]
    Domain[Update domain object]
    Event[Create AuditEvent]
    Change[Create AuditChange rows]
    DB[(PostgreSQL)]
    Corr[Correlation ID]
    Remote[SSO/File Service audit]

    Req --> Corr
    Corr --> Policy
    Policy --> Tx
    Tx --> Domain
    Tx --> Event
    Event --> Change
    Domain --> DB
    Event --> DB
    Req --> Remote
